This is a customized fork of the original Icecast-KH project, tailored for use with the Streaming.Center: https://streaming.center/ control panel.


It includes several important updates and fixes specifically designed to enhance compatibility and performance with Streaming.Center.

XSL status recovery
-------------------

The XSL cache gives each initial load or refresh one owning request. Expiring
waiters release their references without clearing that owner's pending flag.
An abandoned initial load remains retryable and its cache slot can be evicted.
All transformation failures release the stylesheet read lock, including a
missing stylesheet. A refresh also frees its preceding disposition string.

Run `python3 tests/xslt_cache/run.py` for deterministic waiter/loader expiry,
retry ownership, lock-release, and real-libxslt transformation checks.
Run `python3 tests/xslt_cache/http_check.py --icecast /path/to/rebuilt/icecast`
for concurrent HTTP requests, cache eviction, missing stylesheets and continued
MP3 delivery. The HTTP check uses FFmpeg and a temporary loopback server.

These checks do not establish the cause of the October 28 production incident.
Its HTTP access log and warning-level XSL diagnostics were unavailable.
